=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/91006211/1ea2d9c755c0dcf4a7ae99b1b4dd2bdf_3043381845492335147.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">猎袭装·影铁的毕业武器。被动能根据角色移速加成获得物理和元素伤害加成，影铁进入超限状态会提高移速，因此能吃到较高加成。另外被动本身也附带一定移速加成，因此其他镰刀角色也可用于过渡。主动能造成持续可观的雷电伤害，契合影铁和迷迭的输出特性。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/91006211/1ea2d9c755c0dcf4a7ae99b1b4dd2bdf_3043381845492335147.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
